  "how_introduced": "Yes. AI-authored commit 39806871c9720bf8afdcf3e061095c0dd63dea7f created the vulnerable OAuth DCR flow: the consent form accepted an attacker-controlled `ha_url`, `_validate_ha_credentials()` made server-side requests to that URL and returned distinct error messages, and the same URL was propagated into token claims / proxy clients. A later AI-assisted commit 1399f5a30354c1e0bf79f882fb7e0769e7c84431 preserved that design in rewritten token-serialization code, but the original introduction was already in 39806871c.",
